{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>מבושל</b> Two times in the Masorah: ובשל / מבושל. \"And I will not accept meat that is מבושל from you\" — in the passage of Hophni and Phinehas — to teach that they would profane the holy offerings of HaShem in every matter, even to cook the Paschal offering, for they would eat them according to all that their heart desired."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:32.197326491Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}